# Workspace runtime and local state
**/.kilo/blender.lock.json
**/.kilo/*.log
.temp/
.tmp/

# Blender autosaves and backups
**/*.blend1
**/*.blend2
**/*.blend@
**/*.blend~
**/*.blend[0-9]
**/blender.crash.txt
**/*.crash.txt
**/*.tx

# Work-in-progress renders and manual snapshots
**/renders/wip/**
!**/renders/wip/.gitkeep
!**/renders/wip/README.md
**/backups/**
!**/backups/.gitkeep
!**/backups/README.md

# External assets: keep metadata, not binaries by default
**/assets/external/**
!**/assets/external/README.md
!**/assets/external/SOURCE_TEMPLATE.md
!**/assets/external/**/README.md
!**/assets/external/**/SOURCE.md
!**/assets/external/**/LICENSE*
!**/assets/external/**/.gitkeep

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
